# Shuttlewreck Reef (CIPlay shuttlewreck_reef), story pass 10-24s: cabin, manifest, puffers, luggage, the
# teacher's note on seat 14, the ticket, the depot chest + clerk's note, the summit locker (no key) + timetable.
island Shuttlewreck Reef
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Night Shuttle
zone surface_buoy
zone cabin
air cabin
expect step 1
read Shuttle manifest
expect step 2
kill Puffer fish
expect step 3
open Luggage rack
wait 3
expect item ExplosiveGoo 2
expect step 4
read Teacher's note
expect step 5
zone sw_ridge
zone sw_cave
read Seat 14's ticket
expect step 6
air sw_dair
open Shuttle depot chest
wait 3
expect step 7
read Depot clerk's note
expect step 8
zone sw_summit
open Depot rock locker
wait 3
read Shuttle timetable
expect done
